\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px; height:14px;max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n                Integrates effortlessly with existing tools and systems.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n      </ul>\n <div class=\"text-center\"> \n  <a href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/webapp-payroll\" class=\"btn bg-primary text-white my-4 mx-auto\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1  lg:grid-cols-2 place-items-center\" style=\"background-color:#fdf8ed; margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px\">\n    <div  style=\"height:100%;\" >\n       <img style=\"height:100%;object-fit:cover;\" src=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5gRIVZJLIsYd-BLylWuQqa35NZwwCQlmcY9nWiGWc2DPBHV0VrOm33GyIP1raLhgvYIWFN-cIuWmVTuufxmHS-Zq4fdSRE9TuRODmV42kwL3xVbg8Cj0GyKlPNKKGfo1J6qjrvsvwce6JXcmqJHJx=w919-h919-s-no-gm?authuser=0\">\n    </div>\n   <div style=\"padding:20px\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg text-primary mb-4 text-center\">What\'s in It for you?</h2>\n      <ul>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <div style=\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px; height:14px; max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n                Less Stress: Say goodbye to late nights juggling administrative chaos.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n             <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n               <div style=\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px;  height:14px;max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n              More Focus: Channel your energy into growing your business.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <div style=\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px; height:14px;max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n               Happier Teams: Ensure timely, accurate payments and streamlined HR processes.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-start  gap-2\">\n                <div style=\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px; height:14px;max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n             Better Control: Enjoy real-time insights into payroll and HR activities.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n             <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <div style=\"width:17px; height:17px\">\n                     <img style=\"width: 14px; height:14px;max-width:unset;margin-top:5px\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n               <p style=\"padding:0;\" class=\"mb-0\">\n               Improved Productivity: Spend less time on paperwork and more time on strategy.\n               </p>\n            </li>\n      </ul>\n  <div class=\"text-center\"> \n<a href=\"https://calendly.com/carlodm-fbs/demo-discovery-call?month=2025-01\" class=\"btn bg-primary text-white my-4\">Book a demo</a>\n</div>\n   </div>\n</div>\n\n<p>\n <b>Upgrade Your Agency with Our HRIS and Payroll System</b>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nAt Frontline Business Solutions, Inc., we offer cutting-edge HR Information System and Online Payroll System solutions tailored for freelance agencies. Our systems provide an integrated approach to employee and payroll management, ensuring your agency runs smoothly and efficiently.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nIf you\'re ready to streamline your HR and payroll operations, contact us today and discover how our solutions can take your freelance agency to the next level!\n</p>\n', '', '', 0, '', 'default-receiver', '2025-03-17 07:40:30', '2025-03-17 08:08:04'),
(17, 1, '[{\"name\":\"insight-feb2025.webp\",\"id\":\"1QTPJc5BeR_PJyhLPfXRmoxixVBt_3-cS\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-17 08:17:41\"}]', 'Virtual Assistant', 'Why Virtual Assistants Are the Secret Weapon for Business Success', 'why-virtual-assistants-are-the-secret-weapon-for-business-success', '2025-02-28', '<p>\n      Imagine waking up to a to-do list that feels never-ending—emails flooding\n      your inbox, social media accounts needing updates, and administrative\n      tasks piling up. Sound familiar? If you\'re like most business owners,\n      you\'ve likely felt stretched thin, trying to manage everything on your\n      own. But what if you didn’t have to?\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      Welcome to the world of <strong>Virtual Assistance Services</strong>,\n      where your business runs efficiently without you being overwhelmed by the\n      small yet essential tasks.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <b>The Struggles of Running a Business Alone</b>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Running a business is rewarding, but let’s be honest—it comes with\n      challenges that can slow down your momentum:\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"margin-left: 30px\">\n      <li>\n        <strong>Time Constraints:</strong>\n        <p>\n          You’re caught up in mundane tasks instead of strategizing for growth.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>High Operational Costs:</strong>\n        <p>\n          Hiring in-house employees can be expensive with salaries, benefits,\n          and office space.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Lack of Specialized Skills:</strong>\n        <p>\n          Not everyone is an expert in social media, content marketing, customer\n          service, or web design.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Work Overload:</strong>\n        <p>\n          Trying to do it all leads to burnout, reduced creativity, and missed\n          opportunities.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      <b>The Smart Solution: Virtual Assistants </b>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      A Virtual Assistant (VA) can be a game-changer for your business. Whether\n      you’re a solopreneur, startup, or growing company, VAs provide expert\n      support without the overhead costs of a full-time employee.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      At Frontline Business Solutions, our\n      <strong>Virtual Assistant mostly covers:</strong>\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Administrative Support</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Managing emails, scheduling, and data entry, so you stay organized\n          and efficient.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Social Media Management</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Engaging content creation, posting, and interaction to grow your\n          online presence.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Customer Support</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Ensuring prompt and professional responses to inquiries, boosting\n          customer satisfaction.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Web & Graphic Design</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Creating visually appealing designs and user-friendly websites to\n          elevate your brand.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Content Marketing</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Optimizing content to improve search rankings and drive traffic to\n          your business.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      <b>Why Businesses Are Turning to Virtual Assistants</b>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Still wondering why businesses are making the switch? Here are some\n      undeniable benefits:\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Cost Efficiency</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Pay only for the hours or tasks needed, saving money compared to\n          full-time hires.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Increased Productivity</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Focus on your core business while essential tasks are handled\n          professionally.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Flexibility & Scalability</strong>\n        <p>– Easily scale services up or down as business demands change.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <strong>Access to Global Talent</strong>\n        <p>\n          – Work with experts who specialize in various fields, from marketing\n          to tech support.\n        </p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      <b>Take Back Your Time and Grow Your Business </b>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      If you’ve been feeling stuck in the day-to-day grind, it’s time for a\n      change. Imagine the freedom to focus on scaling your business while an\n      experienced Virtual Assistant takes care of the rest.\n      <strong>Are you ready to work smarter, not harder?</strong>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Let’s get started! Contact us today and discover how our Virtual\n      Assistance Services can help transform your business.\n    </p>', '', '', 0, '', 'default-receiver', '2025-03-17 08:17:34', '2025-03-17 08:26:23'),
(18, 1, '[{\"name\":\"sonny-angara-gma-news-image.jpg\",\"id\":\"1yBXhL2YGl1-A1gCa2o6acsdt1aGBkBxu\",\"datetime\":\"2025-03-17 09:15:43\"}]', 'Skills Development', 'DepEd’s Revamped Senior High School Curriculum: Enhancing Employability of SHS Graduates', 'DepEd’s-Revamped-Senior-High-School-Curriculum-Enhancing-Employability-of-SHS-Graduates', '2025-03-06', '<p class=\"mb-6\">\nThe Department of Education (DepEd) has announced a significant overhaul of the Senior High School (SHS) curriculum, set to commence in School Year (SY) 2025-2026. This initiative aims to streamline the curriculum by reducing the number of core subjects, thereby enhancing the employability of SHS graduates through increased focus on practical skills and work immersion.\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Reduction of Core Subjects</b></p>\n\n<p  class=\"mb-6\">Under the current SHS curriculum, students are required to complete 15 core subjects. The revised curriculum proposes a reduction of these core subjects to just five or six. Education Secretary Sonny Angara emphasized that this change is intended to provide students with more time for on-the-job training and work immersion, aligning their education more closely with industry needs. This adjustment aims to address the employability challenges faced by SHS graduates who often lack work experience. <sup>[1]</sup>\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Implementation Timeline</b></p>\n<p  class=\"mb-6\">\nThe phased implementation of the revised SHS curriculum is scheduled to begin in SY 2025-2026. While the original plan targeted 2026, efforts are underway to advance this timeline to 2025. However, due to concerns from some educational institutions regarding the rapid transition, a phased approach will be adopted to facilitate a smoother implementation process.  <sup>[2]</sup>\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Enhanced Focus on Work Immersion</b></p>\n<p  class=\"mb-6\">\nBy reducing the number of core subjects, the revised curriculum allocates more time for students to engage in work immersion and on-the-job training. This shift aims to equip SHS graduates with practical skills and experiences, thereby increasing their employability even if they lack extensive work experience. The emphasis on work immersion is designed to align educational outcomes with industry requirements, ensuring that graduates are better prepared to meet the demands of the workforce. <sup>[3]</sup>\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Collaboration with Industry Experts</b></p>\n<p  class=\"mb-6\">\nTo ensure that the revised curriculum meets industry standards and addresses current job market needs, DepEd is collaborating with experts from various sectors. This collaboration aims to reshape standards in key areas such as English, Science, and Mathematics, making the education system more flexible and aligned with industry demands. <sup>[4]</sup>\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Industry Partnership</b></p>\n<p >\nThe planned revisions to the SHS curriculum represent a strategic effort by DepEd to enhance the quality and relevance of basic education in the Philippines. By simplifying the curriculum and placing greater emphasis on practical training, the initiative seeks to improve the employability of SHS graduates, ensuring they are better equipped to contribute effectively to the workforce. One of the key ways to make this happen is for schools to partner with industry leaders like <a href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\"> Frontline Business Solutions</a>, which provides work-related and actual industry experience for students in fields such as Information Technology, Accounting, and Administrative work. Such collaborations ensure that students gain hands-on training and exposure to real-world work environments, making them more competitive in their chosen careers.\n</p>\n\n<p  class=\"mb-6\">For schools interested in partnering with Frontline Business Solutions, they can visit this <a href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/work-immersion\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\">link</a> to learn more about their work immersion program.\n</p>\n\n<p>References:</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style:disc;margin-left:19px;font-size:12px\">\n<li>Image courtesy of GMA News</li>\n<li>\n <sup>[1]</sup><a href=\"https://www.deped.gov.ph/2024/11/07/deped-set-to-simplify-senior-high-school-curriculum/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\">https://www.deped.gov.ph/2024/11/07/deped-set-to-simplify-senior-high-school-curriculum/</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n <sup>[2]</sup><a href=\"https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/topstories/nation/933716/deped-revised-shs-curriculum-sy-2025-2026/story/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\">https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/topstories/nation/933716/deped-revised-shs-curriculum-sy-2025-2026/story/</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n <sup>[3]</sup><a href=\"https://mb.com.ph/2024/11/7/revised-senior-high-school-curriculum\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\">https://mb.com.ph/2024/11/7/revised-senior-high-school-curriculum</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n <sup>[4]</sup><a href=\"https://www.sunstar.com.ph/davao/deped-set-to-simplify-senior-high-school-curriculum\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;text-decoration:underline\"> https://www.sunstar.com.ph/davao/deped-set-to-simplify-senior-high-school-curriculum</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n', '', '', 0, '', 'default-receiver', '2025-03-17 09:15:40', '2025-03-17 09:16:24');

